# History: bounded-campaign-publication-aggregation

## v1.0.0 (2026-09-11)

Created the rule for promoting the latest cumulative reports to a campaign root when redundant
per-cycle copies would exhaust a bounded public projection. The rule preserves immutable prior
cycles and requires hash, byte-budget, omission, and atomic-rollback evidence.

Provenance: Privacy-safe generalization from a locally verified publication-extension regression.
